<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S7.SS3" title="In 7. Evaluation ‣ Hetis: Serving LLMs in Heterogeneous GPU Clusters with Fine-grained and Dynamic Parallelism" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7.3 </span>Module-level Performance Evaluation</span></a></li>
