<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Hetis: Serving LLMs in Heterogeneous GPU Clusters with Fine-grained and Dynamic Parallelism</h1>
<span class="ltx_pubnotes ltx_pubnotes_meta"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_conference"><span class="ltx_note_name">Conference: </span>The International Conference for High Performance Computing, Networking, Storage and Analysis; November 16–21, 2025; St Louis, MO, USA</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_booktitle">The International Conference for High Performance Computing, Networking, Storage and Analysis (SC ’25), November 16–21, 2025, St Louis, MO, USA</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_doi"><span class="ltx_note_name">DOI: </span><a href="https://doi.org/10.1145/3712285.3759784">10.1145/3712285.3759784</a></span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_isbn"><span class="ltx_note_name">ISBN: </span>979-8-4007-1466-5/2025/11</span></span></span>
